            <note corresp="#d75-f5" n="3" xml:id="d75-f5-content">
                <p>Tehran advised, on March 17, that Minister of the Interior Ahmadi “told
                    Schwarzkopf March 15 Iran Govt wished to continue services of gendarmerie
                    mission without change. He assured Schwarzkopf emphatically that he would have
                    full command authority and all prerogatives as specified in agreement.”
                    (telegram 285, 891.105A/3–1748). Regarding the note of February 7, see first
                    footnote 1, <ref target="#pg107">p. 107</ref>.</p>
            </note>
